          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra/Double Trouble (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Double Trouble (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lonnie (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Murder</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fugitives</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Heavy Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Emotional Manipulation</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra is obsessed with Adora</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora just sees her as a good friend</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Double Trouble is a bastard</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Stabbing</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>There is a bit of sex later</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I'm earning this explicit rating</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>be gay do crimes</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra has issues</rdf:li>
